==German==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈhaːfɱ̩/|/ˈhaːfən/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-Hafen.ogg|audio|lang=de}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|gml|de}} {{m|gml|havene|g=f|g2=m}}. The word was already borrowed into {{etyl|gmh|de}} as {{m|gml|habene}}; the modern form with ''-f-'' is a later adaptation once again based on the Middle Low German form. Ultimately from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*habnō|g=f}}. Cognate to {{etyl|nl|-}} and {{etyl|en|-}} {{term|haven}}.

